; classify-three.tasm — classify N values in a loop, three-way branch per value.
; The loop-control test (keep going?) is a genuinely binary decision and is
; written identically in both variants, so only the classification differs.
        LOADI 6
        STORE count
loop:   LOAD  count
        BR3   more
more:   .table done, done, body
body:   IN
        BR3   sgn
sgn:    .table neg, zero, pos
neg:    LOADI -1
        JMP   emit
zero:   LOADI 0
        JMP   emit
pos:    LOADI 1
emit:   OUT
        LOAD  count
        ADDI  -1
        STORE count
        JMP   loop
done:   HALT
        .org  -1
count:  .word 0
